#: includes/inc-botblocker-wp-abilities-diagnostics.php:2443
msgid "Creates a short-lived custom rule whose comment must start with bbcs-harness: and whose expiry is mandatory. Refuses other comments and missing TTL. Requires confirm \"SEED\" and supports dry_run."
msgstr "Crea una regla personalizada de corta duración cuyo comentario debe empezar por bbcs-harness: y cuya caducidad es obligatoria. Rechaza otros comentarios y la falta de TTL. Requiere confirmar \"SEED\" y es compatible con dry_run."

#: includes/inc-botblocker-wp-abilities.php:460
